 .../orchestration-v2/Adapters/PiAdapterV2.ts  | 80 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../src/orchestration-v2/Adapters/PiRpc.ts    | 24 ++++--
 3 files changed, 120 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

